.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Two pages of a navigation stack: \fBroot\fR and the page \fBpushed\fR over it. Pushing slides \fBtop\fR in from the end edge while \fBroot\fR moves a third of the way out under a fading shade; popping reverses it, on libadwaita's navigation spring (damping ratio 1, mass 1, stiffness 1000). Both pages stay mounted so each keeps its state.
.SH FUNCTIONS
.TP
.B push_stack(root: impl Into<Element<'a, M, Theme>>, top: impl Into<Element<'a, M, Theme>>, pushed: bool)
